OL,4,BAlcaraz battles back against Shelton   
OL,5,Bto reach final                         
OL,6,GCarlos Alcaraz will have the chance to 
OL,7,Gend his wait for a first ATP Finals    
OL,8,Gtitle after completing a superb        
OL,9,Gcomeback victory over Ben Shelton.     
OL,11,FThe indomitable Spaniard recovered     
OL,12,Ffrom a flat start to outlast Shelton 3-
OL,13,F6 6-3 7-6 (7-1) and secure a return to 
OL,14,Fthe showpiece, 12 months after losing  
OL,15,Fto Jannik Sinner.                      
OL,17,FAlcaraz again competed with strapping  
OL,18,Faround his upper-left leg having       
OL,19,Finjured his hamstring earlier this     
OL,20,Fweek, but produced his best tennis     
OL,21,Fwhen it mattered most.                 
